          "description": "List what this truecopy lock pins, without re-verifying it. Returns each entry with the kind of artifact (skill, mcp, or file), the scan verdict recorded at pin time, and whether it carries a signature. Use this to see the vetted set at a glance — what an agent is permitted to run — or to confirm the gate is reading the lock you expect. For whether those bytes are still unchanged, call truecopy-verify instead. Read-only.",
